      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Microsoft Teams Node\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n* Sends messages to Teams channels or chats\n* Creates or manages channels, messages, and tasks\n* Supports advanced operations like forms and message actions\n* Uses Microsoft OAuth2 credentials\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\n1. Add the Teams node, choose an operation, and select a channel or chat  \n2. Configure the message and test the node\n\n**LIMITATIONS:**\n* Some actions require Microsoft Graph via HTTP Request  \n* Channel access depends on permissions\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Automated alerts and notifications  \n* Posting workflow summaries  \n* Creating messages or tasks from upstream events  \n* Integrating enterprise systems with Teams\n\n**REFERENCE:**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.microsoftteams/\n",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
